=You choose stories for a daily post series about European startup funding.
Rounds (index: data):
{{ $json.rounds_text }}
Pick the 3 most interesting rounds. Prioritize larger amounts, AI/deep tech/fintech, and products that are easy to explain. Then write a trend note: 2–3 sentences on any pattern across all rounds, based only on the data.
Return ONLY JSON: {"picks":[{"i":0,"why":"one short sentence"}],"trend":""}

